# Cloudflare Pages redirects (https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/)
#
# The public pages have the prefix of their language (/fr/about, /en/about). The root and the addresses
# without prefix (the ones of the shop before the languages) lead to the French pages.
/              /fr                      302
/about         /fr/about                301
/legal-notice  /fr/legal-notice         301
/terms-of-sale /fr/terms-of-sale        301
/products      /fr/products             301
/products/*    /fr/products/:splat      301
